      "note": "Both interpolated values are integers by construction and neither is reachable from user input. multiplier is Integer(md5_hex.to_i(16) % 996 + 1), so 1..996; modulus is Integer(SHUFFLE_MODULUS), the literal 997. Integer() raises rather than coerces, so a non-integer would fail loudly here rather than reach the query. The third interpolation is RECENCY_SQL, a frozen constant with no input in it. ORDER BY cannot take a bind parameter, so interpolation is the only shape available; Brakeman flags any dynamic argument to Arel.sql and cannot follow the digest chain that proves the range. Reviewed 2026-08-13 while unblocking brgen CI, which this one warning was failing."
